<title>USA: Fed says it added $3.505 bln via overnight RP.</title>
<headline>Fed says it added $3.505 bln via overnight RP.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a $3.505 billion to the banking system on Tuesday via overnight system repurchase agreements, the Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>(( --N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1679 ))</p>
